WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.030
Your CSAT marks don't count

2
00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:03.577
in the merit list.

3
00:00:03.577 --> 00:00:04.488
But fail it,

4
00:00:04.488 --> 00:00:05.827
and your GS score is

5
00:00:05.827 --> 00:00:07.557
never even checked.

6
00:00:07.895 --> 00:00:10.238
It has 80 questions for

7
00:00:10.238 --> 00:00:11.176
200 marks,

8
00:00:11.176 --> 00:00:12.747
in two hours.

9
00:00:13.083 --> 00:00:15.314
You need 33 percent.

10
00:00:15.314 --> 00:00:17.574
That's 66 marks out of

11
00:00:17.574 --> 00:00:18.556
200.

12
00:00:18.889 --> 00:00:20.530
CSAT came in 2011,

13
00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:23.314
and counted towards the cutoff.

14
00:00:23.314 --> 00:00:24.380
From 2015,

15
00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:27.156
it became qualifying only.

16
00:00:27.491 --> 00:00:28.762
Your turn.

17
00:00:28.762 --> 00:00:31.054
What has CSAT been since

18
00:00:31.054 --> 00:00:32.076
2015?
